WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.167
- Last semester of college I
was, like, well this is it.

00:00:10.171 --> 00:00:11.648
- College isn't about being popular.

00:00:11.648 --> 00:00:13.376
It's about being yourself
and finding people

00:00:13.376 --> 00:00:15.223
who wouldn't want you to be anyone else.

00:00:15.223 --> 00:00:17.278
- Spend time building those relationships,

00:00:17.278 --> 00:00:20.195
'cause as an adult you
have to try really hard.

00:00:20.195 --> 00:00:21.486
- Join as many clubs as possible,

00:00:21.486 --> 00:00:22.591
because you're not going to have

00:00:22.591 --> 00:00:25.147
an opportunity like
that outside of college.

00:00:25.147 --> 00:00:27.577
- This is the time where you can explore

00:00:27.577 --> 00:00:29.457
and discover your sexuality.

00:00:29.457 --> 00:00:30.540
Just be safe.

00:00:32.518 --> 00:00:34.918
- I wish I knew in college
to take more classes

00:00:34.918 --> 00:00:36.905
that I'm curious and interested in.

00:00:36.905 --> 00:00:40.059
- And the more you take
your time for yourself

00:00:40.059 --> 00:00:41.567
you'll discover what you want to do

00:00:41.567 --> 00:00:43.153
and where you want to go in life.

00:00:43.153 --> 00:00:45.014
- Do everything you can
in those four years.

00:00:45.014 --> 00:00:48.090
And if you take five, don't feel bad.

00:00:48.090 --> 00:00:51.098
- Definitely do internships in college.

00:00:51.098 --> 00:00:52.794
Do ten if you can.

00:00:52.794 --> 00:00:55.256
- If you graduate with a certain
degree or a certain major,

00:00:55.256 --> 00:00:57.457
it doesn't necessarily mean

00:00:57.457 --> 00:00:59.473
that you have to go into that field.

00:00:59.473 --> 00:01:02.304
- Don't be afraid to have
crazy, ambitious career goals.

00:01:02.304 --> 00:01:03.393
Because if you don't dream,

00:01:03.393 --> 00:01:07.176
then no one else is
going to dream for you.

00:01:07.176 --> 00:01:10.129
- Sometimes in college, you
want people to be a certain way,

00:01:10.129 --> 00:01:11.905
so you try to change people.

00:01:11.905 --> 00:01:14.042
- You have to try and let
go of that negative energy,

00:01:14.042 --> 00:01:15.601
and just keep the people in your life

00:01:15.601 --> 00:01:18.283
who are really adding to
it not detracting from it.

00:01:18.283 --> 00:01:19.116
- Talk it out.

00:01:19.116 --> 00:01:20.169
Even though it sucks.

00:01:20.169 --> 00:01:21.442
Because the sooner you talk about it,

00:01:21.442 --> 00:01:22.640
the sooner the problem's done

00:01:22.640 --> 00:01:24.418
and then you can focus on other things.

00:01:24.418 --> 00:01:25.584
- Just take a deep breath,

00:01:25.584 --> 00:01:28.096
because there's gonna be a
lot bigger things in life

00:01:28.096 --> 00:01:30.529
that you're gonna have to worry about.

00:01:30.529 --> 00:01:32.274
- College is not just about

00:01:32.274 --> 00:01:34.529
finding what you're good at career wise,

00:01:34.529 --> 00:01:36.592
it's also about finding yourself.

00:01:36.592 --> 00:01:38.968
When people ask you what
your experience was,

00:01:38.968 --> 00:01:39.840
share it.

00:01:39.840 --> 00:01:42.826
- Something that I really
got out of college was

00:01:42.826 --> 00:01:44.256
making life long friends.

00:01:44.256 --> 00:01:45.479
Cause those'll be the people

00:01:45.479 --> 00:01:47.057
that will be attending
your wedding in the future.

00:01:47.057 --> 00:01:49.609
And that'll be there when you need help.

00:01:49.609 --> 00:01:51.836
- Don't compromise yourself at your core.

00:01:51.836 --> 00:01:55.187
Kind of stick to your guns
and stay true to yourself.

00:01:55.187 --> 00:01:56.728
That's the most important thing.

00:01:56.728 --> 00:01:57.963
- If there's something you want to do

00:01:57.963 --> 00:01:59.769
and you even have a slither of doubt,

00:01:59.769 --> 00:02:01.689
just do everything possible

00:02:01.689 --> 00:02:04.376
because you're not going
to have this chance again.

00:02:04.376 --> 00:02:05.838
- Taking things as they come.

00:02:05.838 --> 00:02:07.243
There is no rule book.

00:02:07.243 --> 00:02:08.747
There is no set plan.

00:02:08.747 --> 00:02:10.936
Whatever you think is necessary,

00:02:10.936 --> 00:02:12.019
just do you.

